# Oracle CPQ MCP — core

> **Mirror only (Cursor).** SSOT: MCP `build_server_instructions` + [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
> Edit `instructions.py` first; refresh this file last.

- Start answers with the active AI model when known.
- Typed tool inputs (`_StrictModel`, `extra="forbid"`); CPQ only via `CPQClient`.
- Never edit profile credentials / OAuth secrets; live CPQ only via MCP tools.
- Template dir read-only; scratch under `tmp/{profile}/{env}/`.
- Tool authoring: [`docs/STANDARDS.md`](../../docs/STANDARDS.md); compliance: `prompts/compliance_check.md`.
- Honor MCP instructions for refined prompt / export / Prompt Studio / local data (including `frugal_mode`). Refined footer: **Elapsed** only — no token counts.
- PRM partner codes: resolve LookupCode via `list_partner_lov` (do not invent `lov_name`).
